This license governs the **source code** of stackclimb.com — the Astro site, its
components, styles, scripts, tests, and build tooling.

It does **not** grant rights over the written content or the authored artwork:
the prose in `src/pages/`, the project descriptions, the hand-drawn SVG figures in
`src/components/figures/`, and the images in `public/` are the author's original
work and are reserved. Reuse of those requires permission. This carve-out is
stated up front so nobody has to infer the split.

